    "body": "Ooh, now this sounds interesting.\r\n\r\nCould you share the full error message you get? It's possible that this is in one of our feature libraries, so you could get at least basic support by disabling the feature.\r\n\r\nAlso, could you briefly explain (or link to a tutorial) on how to get access to android-x86 and termux? Could I test this on Linux using QEMU, or do I have to go get additional hardware? Almost all of my hardware was bought right before the stuff that officially has Win11 support, so I don't think I can run Windows 11/WSA easily.",
