    "body": "Thanks for the info.\r\n\r\nCan you try building with `cargo build --release --no-default-features` and see if that works?\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, our `battery` upstream at https://github.com/svartalf/rust-battery hasn't had any activity in over a year now. `starship-battery` is a copy we made just for security patches, but it seems unlikely that we'll make significant progress towards merging android-x86 support unless someone submits a PR to our repository (or to the upstream, and then upstream accepts it).",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
