    "body": "just for future reference the commands you need to run are:\r\napt install rust rustc-dev\r\ngit clone https://github.com/starship/starship.git\r\ncd starship\r\ncargo build --release --no-default-features (might have to run a few times build appears to fail a lot)\r\ncd target/release\r\ncp starship ~/.cargo/bin (create this file if not already made using mkdir ~/.cargo/bin, and add this directory to path)\r\nthen restart termux and u are good",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
